{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 50,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.43450164794922,
        57.98431396484375,
        388.1087951660156,
        84.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "6. Evidence for recommendations",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.24939727783203,
        79.98431396484375,
        349.2853698730469,
        106.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "for treatment of pneumonia",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 22.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.5670166015625,
        362.6799621582031,
        203.75601196289062
      ],
      "text": "6.1\t Antibiotic treatment for non-severe pneumonia with wheeze",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        207.19261169433594,
        399.0630187988281,
        220.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "Antibiotics are not routinely recommended for children with non-severe pneumonia",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        220.19261169433594,
        399.07275390625,
        233.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "(i.e. fast breathing with no chest indrawing or danger sign) with a wheeze but with no",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        233.19261169433594,
        322.0628356933594,
        246.6826171875
      ],
      "text": "fever (< temperature 38 °C), as the cause is most likely to be viral.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        248.5972900390625,
        255.10281372070312,
        262.5173034667969
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        264.86187744140625,
        399.0528869628906,
        278.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation is applicable only in situations where the health workers",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        277.86187744140625,
        399.12274169921875,
        291.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "are able to assess “wheeze”. The panel observed that there is evidence that WHO",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        290.86187744140625,
        399.0728759765625,
        304.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "criteria for diagnosing pneumonia performs poorly in children with wheeze; that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        303.86187744140625,
        399.1428527832031,
        317.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "the addition of fever to WHO criteria improves diagnostic accuracy in this group",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        316.86187744140625,
        399.02288818359375,
        330.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "of children; and that children with wheeze and no fever are very unlikely to have",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        329.86187744140625,
        142.91290283203125,
        343.3518981933594
      ],
      "text": "bacterial pneumonia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        354.3805236816406,
        231.48292541503906,
        366.3705139160156
      ],
      "text": "6.1.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        370.0351867675781,
        399.09283447265625,
        383.52520751953125
      ],
      "text": "No systematic reviews addressing the effectiveness of antibiotics in children with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        383.0351867675781,
        399.062744140625,
        396.52520751953125
      ],
      "text": "non-severe pneumonia were identified. However, two recent RCTs provide direct",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        396.0351867675781,
        399.0627746582031,
        409.52520751953125
      ],
      "text": "evidence. The evidence for the effectiveness of antibiotics is mixed, in part due to the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        409.0351867675781,
        399.09283447265625,
        422.52520751953125
      ],
      "text": "significant (but as yet undetermined) proportion of children fulfilling the criteria for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        422.0351867675781,
        399.0629577636719,
        435.52520751953125
      ],
      "text": "non-severe pneumonia, who have either a viral illness or non-infectious aetiology. In",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        435.0351867675781,
        399.05291748046875,
        448.52520751953125
      ],
      "text": "Asia, up to 60% of children with non-severe pneumonia are reported to also have an",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        448.0351867675781,
        186.6628875732422,
        461.52520751953125
      ],
      "text": "audible wheeze by auscultation.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        461.0351867675781,
        396.8504943847656,
        474.52520751953125
      ],
      "text": "Observational data provides evidence that: the addition of fever to the WHO cri­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        474.0351867675781,
        399.06280517578125,
        487.52520751953125
      ],
      "text": "teria for pneumonia improves its specificity for children with wheeze, and children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        487.0351867675781,
        399.0630187988281,
        500.52520751953125
      ],
      "text": "with non-severe pneumonia and wheeze, with no fever or history of fever, have a low",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        500.0351867675781,
        399.0829162597656,
        513.5252075195312
      ],
      "text": "risk of bacterial pneumonia and most recover without antibiotics. There is also new",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        513.03515625,
        396.8504943847656,
        526.525146484375
      ],
      "text": "evidence from one trial in Pakistan showing that antibiotics are no better than place­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        299.2204895019531,
        525.815185546875,
        391.6603698730469,
        539.525146484375
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.8",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        526.03515625,
        396.8464050292969,
        539.525146484375
      ],
      "text": "bo for children with WHO-defined non-severe pneumonia ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        547.529052734375,
        357.87286376953125,
        559.6690673828125
      ],
      "text": "Antibiotics in all children presenting with non-severe pneumonia in Pakistan",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        560.5390625,
        399.1029357910156,
        574.029052734375
      ],
      "text": "Hazir et al (2010) conducted a double-blinded, randomized, placebo-controlled",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        573.5390625,
        399.02288818359375,
        587.029052734375
      ],
      "text": "trial of oral amoxicillin versus placebo for non-severe pneumonia in four centres",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        586.5390625,
        399.04290771484375,
        600.029052734375
      ],
      "text": "in Pakistan. Children were enrolled if they fulfilled WHO criteria for non-severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        599.5390625,
        399.0528869628906,
        613.029052734375
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia: cough or difficulty breathing and fast breathing (using age-dependant",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        612.5390625,
        399.0528259277344,
        626.029052734375
      ],
      "text": "WHO cut-offs). The study recruited 900 children, and randomized 450 children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.39480590820312,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.64781188964844,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "36",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}